(property "Design_Notes" "Omron10pin0.5mm dual-contact FPC connector. Logical pin1..10 match TFT-H013A6QQIGC5N10 panel numbering; pin8 TE unused/NC. Cable contact side per panel front/display side, pin10 left/pin1 right in panel front view tail down. Dual-contact does NOT allow reversing numbered pin order. Tail0.30+/-0.05mm matches thickness; panelwidth5.5+/-0.1mm wider tolerance than connector5.5+/-0.05 recommendation, require sample fit/continuity. No old12pin or Waveshare8wire compatibility." (at 242.57 171.58 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
