(property "Description" "One HOTHMI bare round GC9A01 display, no touchscreen; plugs directly through10pin FPC J8. PanelVCI3.2+/-0.2V; older supplied GC9A01 chip operatingmax3.3V. Target3.192V and measure3.0..3.3V; SPI uses same rail. Manufacturer advertises3.3V MCU compatibility but internalIOVCC wiring not provided: logic compatibility remains sample-validation assumption, no absolute guarantee. TE pin8 unused. Backlight Vf3.0..3.4V at40mA specification, use68ohm derated5V resistor and low-side PWM. Contact surface faces same side as display; frontviewtaildown pin10left/pin1right. Verify purchased exact no-touch revision and FPC fit before power." (at 82.55 237.62 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
